#ASSERT `s 621(1) the last day for the notice` (Date 10 3 2023) EQUALS Date 10 4 2023
#ASSERT `s 621(1) the number of days allowed for the notice` (Date 10 3 2023) EQUALS 31
#ASSERT `s 621(1) the company gave notice to the registrar in time` (Date 10 3 2023) (JUST (Date 10 4 2023)) (Date 10 4 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 621(1) the company gave notice to the registrar in time` (Date 10 3 2023) (JUST (Date 10 3 2023)) (Date 10 4 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
