#ASSERT `s 621(1) the company gave notice to the registrar in time` (Date 10 3 2023) (JUST (Date 9 3 2023)) (Date 11 4 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 621(1) the company gave notice to the registrar in time` (Date 10 3 2023) NOTHING (Date 11 4 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 621(1) the company gave notice to the registrar in time` (Date 10 3 2023) NOTHING (Date 10 4 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
