§§ `s 623`
-- four shares of nominal value 2: Step One 8; at 0.5 new units to one old unit, Step Two 4; Step Three 4 / 4 = 1 each
#ASSERT `s 623 Step One: the aggregate of the old nominal values of all the shares of the class` (LIST 2, 2, 2, 2) EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `s 623 Step Two: that amount translated into the new currency` 8 0.5 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `s 623 Step Three: that amount divided by the number of shares in the class` 4 4 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 623 Step Three: that amount divided by the number of shares in the class` 4 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 623 the new nominal value of each share of the class` (LIST 2, 2, 2, 2) 0.5 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 623 the new nominal value of each share of the class` (LIST 2, 2, 2, 2) 1.5 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `s 623 the new nominal value of each share of the class` EMPTY 1.5 EQUALS NOTHING

